></div><section id="cheap-postage-to-finland" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VkdpbqstJ98utr_Finlandd3de.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VkdpbqstJ98utr_Finland.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=3%2C0%2C5433%2C3624&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VkdpbqstJ98utr_Finland.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=3%2C0%2C5433%2C3624&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VkdpbqstJ98utr_Finland.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=3%2C0%2C5433%2C3624&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Cheap postage to Finland</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Among the Scandinavian countries in northern Europe, Finland sits over 1,000 miles away from the UK. At Evri, you can send parcels across the UK and abroad for a low price, no matter their distance. Whether it’s to Finland, the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/usa" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->USA<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/china" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->China<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or closer to home in <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/ireland" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ireland<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, our global network of couriers can deliver your packages wherever they need to go.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Increasing demand in e-commerce, health and wellness, and sustainability markets in Finland has seen huge opportunities for UK businesses to tap into products and services to support growth.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.